{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/imagedecoding"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Load static PNG and JPEG images safely on macOS and Linux."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Loading","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoader"],"anchor":"Loading"},{"title":"Data and Limits","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBA","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"],"anchor":"Data-and-Limits"}],"metadata":{"title":"Image Decoding","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","type":"reference"},{"text":" uses vendored, namespaced pure Swift format decoders and always returns non-premultiplied 8-bit RGBA pixels in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"reference"},{"text":". Animated images and formats other than PNG and JPEG are not supported. JPEG input is limited to 8-bit grayscale and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"three-component color images.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The format decoder is independent from file and URL lifecycle code. Decoding the same bytes with the same limits therefore produces the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same pixels without accessing the network."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Loading Data or Files","anchor":"Loading-Data-or-Files","level":2},{"code":["let loader = PlatformImageLoader()","let fromData = try loader.loadImage(from: encodedData)","let fromFile = try loader.loadImage(from: \"\/absolute\/path\/image.png\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both entry points apply the same validation and return ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when the input cannot be read or decoded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Resource Limits","anchor":"Resource-Limits","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits"},{"type":"text","text":" when creating the loader:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let limits = ImageDecodingLimits(","    maxInputBytes: 8 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDimension: 4_096,","    maxPixelCount: 12_000_000,","    maxFrameCount: 1,","    maxDecodedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDecompressedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024",")","let loader = PlatformImageLoader(limits: limits)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit inspects the image header and validates encoded bytes, dimensions, pixels, frames, decompressed source samples, and the final RGBA","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"allocation before invoking a format decoder. A per-call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxPixelCount"},{"text":" can tighten the loader-wide pixel limit but cannot loosen it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PNG ancillary metadata is discarded because ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" has no metadata surface. This also prevents compressed text or color-profile","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chunks from allocating outside the image decompression limit. PNG image-data chunks are fed to the decoder in bounded pieces, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"malformed trailing decompressed data is rejected.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL loading streams encoded bytes and cancels the transfer as soon as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxInputBytes"},{"type":"text","text":" is exceeded. Cached images are revalidated against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current loader’s dimensions, pixels, frame, and final allocation limits before they are returned."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"anchor":"Guides","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/Preferences":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Pass data from child views up to their ancestors.","type":"text"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Preferences","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferences","type":"topic"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/ImageLoader":{"title":"ImageLoader","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"ki